<!--
  Sukoon's mark: a pointed arch standing on a threshold.

  The arch is the two-centred form of Islamic architecture, and it says what
  the app does without listing features - a doorway holds the noise out, and
  the few who matter walk through it. The opening is deliberately empty: the
  quiet is the point, so nothing fills it.

  Shapes were chosen by elimination. A crescent is Android's own Do Not
  Disturb glyph. A ring above a bar reads as a profile avatar, a ring in a
  bowl reads as a smiley, descending bars read as a music equaliser, and a
  ROUND arch reads as a lowercase "n". The pointed arch collides with none of
  them and still resolves at 48px.

  Geometry is a real two-centred arch: each side is an arc struck from a
  centre on the opposite side of the springing line. The inner curve uses its
  own, wider centres (d=29.46 against the outer 25.25) so the stroke stays
  6.8 wide at the apex instead of ballooning the way concentric arcs do.

  evenOdd is required, not decorative: both subpaths wind the same way, so
  under nonZero the inner arch would fill solid instead of cutting the
  opening. The plinth is a separate path - inside the evenOdd path it would
  punch a hole - and overlaps the feet by 0.5 so no seam shows.

  Everything sits within x 31.95..76.05, y 28.93..80.90, inside the 66dp
  circle an adaptive launcher may crop to.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">
    <path
        android:fillColor="#E9DDFF"
        android:fillType="evenOdd"
        android:pathData="M34.60,75.10 L34.60,65.75 A44.65,44.65 0 0,1 54.00,28.93 A44.65,44.65 0 0,1 73.40,65.75 L73.40,75.10 Z
                          M41.40,75.10 L41.40,65.75 A42.06,42.06 0 0,1 54.00,35.73 A42.06,42.06 0 0,1 66.60,65.75 L66.60,75.10 Z" />
    <path
        android:fillColor="#E9DDFF"
        android:pathData="M35.10,74.60 L72.90,74.60 A3.15,3.15 0 0,1 72.90,80.90 L35.10,80.90 A3.15,3.15 0 0,1 35.10,74.60 Z" />
